ask(c,'What operational capability distinguishes the mobile robot from the fixed-arm comparison in this lecture?', ['It can relocate through the environment to perform tasks at different locations','It must have no manipulation capability','It must always have exactly four wheels','It cannot use a global reference frame'], ['A movable base is not confined to one fixed arm installation.','A mobile platform can carry a manipulator, as later slides show.','Mobility can use different wheel or leg arrangements.','Global reference frames are explicitly used for mobile pose.'])
